  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant DATA_RATING has the value 4</p>
  <p>Used with <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlRequestAgentData" target="_blank">llRequestAgentData</a> to return the string &quot;0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0&quot;.</p>
  <p>The CSV list returned used to contain the positive and negative ratings the user has acquired before ratings were removed from SL.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
