  <h2>Deep Notes</h2>
  <p>History</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Originally returning:
    <ul>
      <li>&quot;pos_behavior, neg_behavior, pos_appearance, neg_appearance, pos_building, neg_building&quot;</li>
    </ul>
  
    </li>
    <li>Negative ratings were later removed, leaving this to return:
    <ul>
      <li>&quot;pos_behavior, 0, pos_appearance, 0, pos_building, 0&quot;</li>
    </ul>
  
    </li>
    <li>Much later ratings were removed outright leaving this to return:
    <ul>
      <li>&quot;0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0&quot;</li>
    </ul>
  
    </li>
  </ul>
